msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置说明"

msgid "In **standalone mode**, use CLI arguments (see :doc:`/contents/usage/index`). In **MCDR mode**, configuration is loaded from MCDR's config file at ``config/resource_pack_server/config.json``."
msgstr "在**独立模式**下，使用 CLI 参数（参见 :doc:`/contents/usage/index`）。在 **MCDR 模式**下，配置从 MCDR 的配置文件 ``config/resource_pack_server/config.json`` 加载。"

msgid "Configuration File"
msgstr "配置文件"

msgid "The config file is auto-generated on first load. Default path (MCDR mode): ``config/resource_pack_server/config.json``."
msgstr "配置文件在首次加载时自动生成。默认路径（MCDR 模式）：``config/resource_pack_server/config.json``。"

msgid "Default config:"
msgstr "默认配置："

msgid "Top-Level Fields"
msgstr "顶级字段"

msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

msgid "Set to ``false`` to disable the plugin entirely"
msgstr "设置为 ``false`` 完全禁用插件"

msgid "Server Configuration"
msgstr "服务器配置"

msgid "``server`` section:"
msgstr "``server`` 部分："

msgid "HTTP server bind address"
msgstr "HTTP 服务器绑定地址"

msgid "HTTP server port"
msgstr "HTTP 服务器端口"

msgid "Directory containing ``.zip`` resource pack files"
msgstr "包含 ``.zip`` 资源包文件的目录"

msgid "Public-facing URL (used if server is behind a proxy)"
msgstr "面向公网的 URL（服务器位于反向代理后时使用）"

msgid "Command Configuration"
msgstr "命令配置"

msgid "``command`` section (MCDR mode only):"
msgstr "``command`` 部分（仅 MCDR 模式）："

msgid "Whether to register MCDR commands"
msgstr "是否注册 MCDR 命令"

msgid "Command prefix"
msgstr "命令前缀"

msgid "Minimum MCDR permission level for commands"
msgstr "命令的最低 MCDR 权限等级"

msgid "Merge Configuration"
msgstr "合并配置"

msgid "``merge`` section:"
msgstr "``merge`` 部分："

msgid "Enable the ``/merged.zip`` endpoint"
msgstr "启用 ``/merged.zip`` 端点"

msgid "Ordered list of pack filenames (highest priority first). Unlisted packs are appended alphabetically."
msgstr "按优先级排序的资源包文件名列表（最高优先级在前）。未列出的包按字母顺序追加。"

msgid "Example: priority ordering"
msgstr "示例：优先级排序"

msgid "With this config, ``vanilla_tweaks.zip`` has the highest priority — its assets override any conflicting assets from lower-priority packs."
msgstr "使用此配置，``vanilla_tweaks.zip`` 具有最高优先级——其资源会覆盖低优先级包中的冲突资源。"
